  <History Date="08-08-25" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (hopeless documentation.  vague.  mostly nonsense.  no pixel layout.  modes 4 and 5 exceed 512 channels which does not comply with DMX standards and cannot be supported as single modes.  implemented as multi-part instead)" Version="0" />
